        <div class="bv-sector">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21V10l6-4v4l6-4v15z"/><path d="M9 21v-4M15 21v-4"/></svg>
          <span>Centros de salud</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bv-sector">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21h16M6 21V9l6-4 6 4v12"/><path d="M9 12h6M9 16h6"/></svg>
          <span>Institutos y laboratorios</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bv-sector">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12s4-7 9-7 9 7 9 7-4 7-9 7-9-7-9-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
          <span>Operadores de PTAR</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =============== CTA FINAL / CONTACTO =============== -->
  <section class="bv-cta" id="contacto" aria-labelledby="bv-cta-title">
    <div class="bv-container">
      <div class="bv-cta__inner">
        <div>
          <h2 class="bv-cta__title" id="bv-cta-title">
            Empecemos con un diagnóstico técnico de tu PTAR.
          </h2>
          <p class="bv-cta__desc">
            Sin compromiso de compra. Evaluamos si BacVita puede aportar valor en tu planta específica
